# The memory sidecar's build context (docker/memory/Dockerfile). BuildKit reads
# this file in preference to the root .dockerignore. Admits only what the image
# copies; everything else in the checkout stays out.
*
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!tsconfig.json
!packages
!src
!extensions
!scripts
!config.example.toml
!docker/memory/entrypoint.sh
**/node_modules
**/.git
# A package's build output and its packed data are built in the image.
packages/*/dist
packages/*/assets
# Agent instruction files, never in an image.
**/CLAUDE.md
